      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 7.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.27,
      "end_seconds": 13.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.36,
      "end_seconds": 18.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I'm here because of periods becoming irregular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.03,
      "end_seconds": 21.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.93,
      "end_seconds": 34.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.0,
      "end_seconds": 59.0,
      "duration_seconds": 11.0,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 81, temp 36.9 degrees. And saturation 97 percent, BP is 117 over 73. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.0,
      "end_seconds": 69.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "It's been five days now. Ah, there was hot flushes, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.52,
      "end_seconds": 77.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Have you had any very heavy bleeding, pelvic pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.01,
      "end_seconds": 82.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "No, uh, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.82,
      "end_seconds": 86.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "And bleeding after sex, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.38,
      "end_seconds": 91.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Nope, no bleeding after sex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.73,
      "end_seconds": 96.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.28,
      "end_seconds": 100.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Okay, so no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.02,
      "end_seconds": 118.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.76,
      "end_seconds": 121.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "I've got depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.18,
      "end_seconds": 126.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.36,
      "end_seconds": 133.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Mirtazapine. I take it 15 milligrams, at night for my mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.11,
      "end_seconds": 135.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.35,
      "end_seconds": 141.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Well, no, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.99,
      "end_seconds": 163.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.43,
      "end_seconds": 167.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.23,
      "end_seconds": 171.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.6,
      "end_seconds": 175.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.62,
      "end_seconds": 192.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.64,
      "end_seconds": 196.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.14,
      "end_seconds": 203.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.18,
      "end_seconds": 204.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.34,
      "end_seconds": 208.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.08,
      "end_seconds": 223.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.47,
      "end_seconds": 227.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.43,
      "end_seconds": 241.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Taking everything into account, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at perimenopause or a thyroid problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 242.51,
      "end_seconds": 244.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.98,
      "end_seconds": 277.72,
      "duration_seconds": 32.74,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like perimenopause, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order a blood count, for irregular periods. We should do a thyroid test for hot flushes. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We'll begin with estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term. That should help with menopausal symptoms. Regular exercise, light layers and avoiding triggers can help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.9,
      "end_seconds": 302.28,
      "duration_seconds": 23.38,
      "text": "Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Please come and see me in three months. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.04,
      "end_seconds": 304.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}